endobj

135 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 113 0 R/T(Together with our donors, partners, and volunteers, we showed up across every front\204and it showed. This report captures the full breadth of COLI's work in 2025: from the 20-For-200 Outreach that brought food, care, and dignity to 200 families in need, to the Skills Acquisition Program that empowered 65 children with skills for lifelong self-reliance, to the Education Sponsorship Initiative that opened school doors for 12 out-of-school children. Every number in this report represents a person. A family. A future reclaimed. This is what it looks like when a community decides to move together.)/E(Together with our donors, partners, and volunteers, we showed up across every front\204and it showed. This report captures the full breadth of COLI's work in 2025: from the 20-For-200 Outreach that brought food, care, and dignity to 200 families in need, to the Skills Acquisition Program that empowered 65 children with skills for lifelong self-reliance, to the Education Sponsorship Initiative that opened school doors for 12 out-of-school children. Every number in this report represents a person. A family. A future reclaimed. This is what it looks like when a community decides to move together.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

