140 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 114 0 R/T(When I started Children of Light Initiatives, I had a conviction before I had a plan. That light, when it enters a dark place, does not negotiate with the darkness. It simply shines.)/E(When I started Children of Light Initiatives, I had a conviction before I had a plan. That light, when it enters a dark place, does not negotiate with the darkness. It simply shines.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

141 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 114 0 R/T(The 20-For-200 Outreach on December 20, 2025 was that conviction made visible. 242 adults and 77 children in Ajegunle received food packs. 31 volunteers gave their time and energy. 8 partner organisations invested in what we were building. A community too often invisible in Nigeria's national conversation experienced something simple and profound \204 that someone had not  forgotten them.)/E(The 20-For-200 Outreach on December 20, 2025 was that conviction made visible. 242 adults and 77 children in Ajegunle received food packs. 31 volunteers gave their time and energy. 8 partner organisations invested in what we were building. A community too often invisible in Nigeria's national conversation experienced something simple and profound \204 that someone had not  forgotten them.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

142 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 114 0 R/T(But we did not stop at food. We believe that dignity is not only about what is on the table today, it is about what a family can build tomorrow. That is why, in 2025, we launched a Skills Acquisition Program that reached 65 children in Ajegunle, equipping them with 4 income-generating skills over a focused 4-week program. Alongside this, we supported 12 out-of-school children through direct education sponsorship, walking with them back into classrooms they had been locked out of by circumstance.)/E(But we did not stop at food. We believe that dignity is not only about what is on the table today, it is about what a family can build tomorrow. That is why, in 2025, we launched a Skills Acquisition Program that reached 65 children in Ajegunle, equipping them with 4 income-generating skills over a focused 4-week program. Alongside this, we supported 12 out-of-school children through direct education sponsorship, walking with them back into classrooms they had been locked out of by circumstance.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

143 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 114 0 R/T(These programs are not peripheral to our mission, they are its heartbeat. As an organisation committed to SDG 4: Quality Education, we understand that lasting change is built on access to learning, not just access to relief. Every child we equip with a skill, and every child we return to school, is a declaration that their potential is worth investing in.)/E(These programs are not peripheral to our mission, they are its heartbeat. As an organisation committed to SDG 4: Quality Education, we understand that lasting change is built on access to learning, not just access to relief. Every child we equip with a skill, and every child we return to school, is a declaration that their potential is worth investing in.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

144 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 114 0 R/T(To every community we have the privilege of serving \204 you matter. One neighbourhood, one family, one person at a time, we will keep showing up. That is our promise.)/E(To every community we have the privilege of serving \204 you matter. One neighbourhood, one family, one person at a time, we will keep showing up. That is our promise.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

