156 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 115 0 R/T(Children of Light Initiatives is a Nigerian nonprofit working at  the intersection of education and food relief for underserved  communities. Our work is rooted in SDG 2: Zero Hunger and  SDG 4: Quality Education, because no child can learn on an  empty stomach and no family can truly thrive without both.)/E(Children of Light Initiatives is a Nigerian nonprofit working at  the intersection of education and food relief for underserved  communities. Our work is rooted in SDG 2: Zero Hunger and  SDG 4: Quality Education, because no child can learn on an  empty stomach and no family can truly thrive without both.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

157 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 115 0 R/T(We are young, committed professionals who believe that  proximity to a problem is not a burden \204 it is an advantage.  We know the communities we serve because we come from them,  live near them, and care about their futures as if they were our  own.)/E(We are young, committed professionals who believe that  proximity to a problem is not a burden \204 it is an advantage.  We know the communities we serve because we come from them,  live near them, and care about their futures as if they were our  own.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[4]>>
