195 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 117 0 R/T(On December 20, 2025,COLI implemented the 20-For-200 Outreach in Ajegunle, Lagos \204 one of Nigeria's most densely populated and underserved communities. The goal was simple and specific: provide food relief and tangible support to vulnerable families during the Christmas season, when need is heightened and visibility often fades.  )/E(On December 20, 2025,COLI implemented the 20-For-200 Outreach in Ajegunle, Lagos \204 one of Nigeria's most densely populated and underserved communities. The goal was simple and specific: provide food relief and tangible support to vulnerable families during the Christmas season, when need is heightened and visibility often fades.  )/Pg 16 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

196 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 117 0 R/T(Ajegunle was chosen deliberately. Food insecurity here is not seasonal \204 it is structural. Families navigate economic pressure, limited formal employment, and inadequate access to social services daily. The name 20-For-200 was both a target and a challenge. What began as an ambition to reach 200 people on the 20th of December became something greater. With the generosity of our donors and partners, we exceeded our original target and reached 319 beneficiaries in a single day.)/E(Ajegunle was chosen deliberately. Food insecurity here is not seasonal \204 it is structural. Families navigate economic pressure, limited formal employment, and inadequate access to social services daily. The name 20-For-200 was both a target and a challenge. What began as an ambition to reach 200 people on the 20th of December became something greater. With the generosity of our donors and partners, we exceeded our original target and reached 319 beneficiaries in a single day.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

