344 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 123 0 R/T(Quality Education is not a luxury. It is a right. In 2025, COLI directly sponsored 12 students through school, removing the financial barriers that keep children out of classrooms. These 12 represent our unwavering commitment to SDG 4, ensuring inclusive and equitable quality education for all. Each sponsorship is a declaration: your circumstances do not determine your future.)/E(Quality Education is not a luxury. It is a right. In 2025, COLI directly sponsored 12 students through school, removing the financial barriers that keep children out of classrooms. These 12 represent our unwavering commitment to SDG 4, ensuring inclusive and equitable quality education for all. Each sponsorship is a declaration: your circumstances do not determine your future.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[11]>>
