<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 124 0 R/T(The 20-For-200 Outreach and other programs were milestones, not a ceiling. COLI is committed to expanding our community programmes, serving more beneficiaries, entering new communities, and deepening the quality of every intervention. We are committed to fostering greater collaboration with partners who share our values, innovating solutions that address the root causes of vulnerability, and amplifying the voices of the people we serve.)/E(The 20-For-200 Outreach and other programs were milestones, not a ceiling. COLI is committed to expanding our community programmes, serving more beneficiaries, entering new communities, and deepening the quality of every intervention. We are committed to fostering greater collaboration with partners who share our values, innovating solutions that address the root causes of vulnerability, and amplifying the voices of the people we serve.)/Pg 23 0 R/K[14]>>
