395 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 125 0 R/T(The 20-For-200 Outreach was more than a programme, it was a declaration of who we are and what we believe. We believe that every person, regardless of their circumstances, deserves dignity, opportunity, and the knowledge that someone sees them.)/E(The 20-For-200 Outreach was more than a programme, it was a declaration of who we are and what we believe. We believe that every person, regardless of their circumstances, deserves dignity, opportunity, and the knowledge that someone sees them.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

396 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 125 0 R/T(When we set out to reach 200 beneficiaries in Ajegunle, we were not simply counting numbers. We were counting lives, each one with a story, a struggle, and a strength that humbles us. What we gave in resources, we received back tenfold in purpose and resolve.)/E(When we set out to reach 200 beneficiaries in Ajegunle, we were not simply counting numbers. We were counting lives, each one with a story, a struggle, and a strength that humbles us. What we gave in resources, we received back tenfold in purpose and resolve.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

397 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 125 0 R/T(Among the moments that stayed with me most deeply were the faces of 65 children in Ajegunle \204 young minds who gained practical skills through our acquisition programme, many of them for the very first time. And the 12 out-of-school children who, because someone chose to show up, are now back in a classroom where they belong. These are not statistics. These are futures reclaimed.)/E(Among the moments that stayed with me most deeply were the faces of 65 children in Ajegunle \204 young minds who gained practical skills through our acquisition programme, many of them for the very first time. And the 12 out-of-school children who, because someone chose to show up, are now back in a classroom where they belong. These are not statistics. These are futures reclaimed.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

398 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 125 0 R/T(This is why COLI's commitment to SDG 4 \204 Quality Education is not a footnote in our work. It is a cornerstone. We do not believe in relief alone. We believe in transformation : in equipping people with the tools to build lives that no longer depend on emergency intervention. Sustainable impact is the only kind we are willing to settle for.)/E(This is why COLI's commitment to SDG 4 \204 Quality Education is not a footnote in our work. It is a cornerstone. We do not believe in relief alone. We believe in transformation : in equipping people with the tools to build lives that no longer depend on emergency intervention. Sustainable impact is the only kind we are willing to settle for.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

399 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 125 0 R/T(As we close this chapter and open the next, I want to express my deepest gratitude to our team, our volunteers, our partners, and above all, to the communities who welcomed us. You are the reason COLI exists. You are the reason we will not stop.This is not the end. This is the foundation upon which we build.)/E(As we close this chapter and open the next, I want to express my deepest gratitude to our team, our volunteers, our partners, and above all, to the communities who welcomed us. You are the reason COLI exists. You are the reason we will not stop.This is not the end. This is the foundation upon which we build.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

