701 0 obj
<</Title(Together with our donors, partners, and volunteers, we showed up across every front\204and it showed. This report captures the full breadth of COLI's work in 2025: from the 20-For-200 Outreach that brought food, care, and dignity to 200 families in need, to the Skills Acquisition Program that empowered 65 children with skills for lifelong self-reliance, to the Education Sponsorship Initiative that opened school doors for 12 out-of-school children. Every number in this report represents a person. A family. A future reclaimed. This is what it looks like when a community decides to move together.)/Dest[12 0 R/Fit]/Parent 411 0 R>>
endobj

702 0 obj
<</Title(A Conviction Before a Plan)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 411 0 R/First 797 0 R/Last 798 0 R/Count -7/Next 799 0 R>>
endobj

703 0 obj
<</Title(Beyond Food Relief \204 Our Year of Impact)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 800 0 R/First 801 0 R/Last 802 0 R/Count -3/Next 412 0 R>>
endobj

704 0 obj
<</Title(The 20-For-200 Outreach and other programs were milestones, not a ceiling. COLI is committed to expanding our community programmes, serving more beneficiaries, entering new communities, and deepening the quality of every intervention. We are committed to fostering greater collaboration with partners who share our values, innovating solutions that address the root causes of vulnerability, and amplifying the voices of the people we serve.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 412 0 R/Next 803 0 R>>
endobj

705 0 obj
<</Title(Volunteer)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 412 0 R/Prev 804 0 R/First 805 0 R/Last 806 0 R/Count -3>>
endobj

706 0 obj
<</Title(When we set out to reach 200 beneficiaries in Ajegunle, we were not simply counting numbers. We were counting lives, each one with a story, a struggle, and a strength that humbles us. What we gave in resources, we received back tenfold in purpose and resolve.)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 30 0 R/Prev 413 0 R/Next 807 0 R>>
endobj

707 0 obj
<</Title(As we close this chapter and open the next, I want to express my deepest gratitude to our team, our volunteers, our partners, and above all, to the communities who welcomed us. You are the reason COLI exists. You are the reason we will not stop.This is not the end. This is the foundation upon which we build.)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 30 0 R/Prev 808 0 R/Next 414 0 R>>
endobj

708 0 obj
<</Title(CEO, Children of Light Initiatives)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 414 0 R/Next 709 0 R>>
endobj

709 0 obj
<</Title("Service is not what we do \204 it is who we are.")/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 414 0 R/Prev 708 0 R>>
endobj

