797 0 obj
<</Title(When I started Children of Light Initiatives, I had a conviction before I had a plan. That light, when it enters a dark place, does not negotiate with the darkness. It simply shines.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 702 0 R/Next 881 0 R>>
endobj

