801 0 obj
<</Title(The 20-For-200 Outreach was one chapter of a year dedicated to transforming lives. COLI's commitment extends beyond emergency relief to sustainable, skills-based interventions that create pathways out of vulnerability.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 703 0 R/Next 890 0 R>>
endobj

