807 0 obj
<</Title(Among the moments that stayed with me most deeply were the faces of 65 children in Ajegunle \204 young minds who gained practical skills through our acquisition programme, many of them for the very first time. And the 12 out-of-school children who, because someone chose to show up, are now back in a classroom where they belong. These are not statistics. These are futures reclaimed.)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 30 0 R/Prev 706 0 R/Next 808 0 R>>
endobj

808 0 obj
<</Title(This is why COLI's commitment to SDG 4 \204 Quality Education is not a footnote in our work. It is a cornerstone. We do not believe in relief alone. We believe in transformation : in equipping people with the tools to build lives that no longer depend on emergency intervention. Sustainable impact is the only kind we are willing to settle for.)/Dest[24 0 R/Fit]/Parent 30 0 R/Prev 807 0 R/Next 707 0 R>>
endobj

