881 0 obj
<</Title(The 20-For-200 Outreach on December 20, 2025 was that conviction made visible. 242 adults and 77 children in Ajegunle received food packs. 31 volunteers gave their time and energy. 8 partner organisations invested in what we were building. A community too often invisible in Nigeria's national conversation experienced something simple and profound \204 that someone had not  forgotten them.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 702 0 R/Prev 797 0 R/Next 944 0 R>>
endobj

882 0 obj
<</Title(With gratitude, faith, and full accountability.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 702 0 R/Prev 945 0 R/Next 798 0 R>>
endobj

883 0 obj
<</Title(Founder, Children of Light Initiatives)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 798 0 R>>
endobj

884 0 obj
<</Title(Children of Light Initiatives is a Nigerian nonprofit working at  the intersection of education and food relief for underserved  communities. Our work is rooted in SDG 2: Zero Hunger and  SDG 4: Quality Education, because no child can learn on an  empty stomach and no family can truly thrive without both.)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 799 0 R/Next 946 0 R>>
endobj

885 0 obj
<</Title(Our Mission)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 799 0 R/Prev 947 0 R/First 948 0 R/Last 949 0 R/Count -2>>
endobj

886 0 obj
<</Title(Three Values That Guide Us)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 799 0 R/First 950 0 R/Last 951 0 R/Count -3/Next 952 0 R>>
endobj

887 0 obj
<</Title(Where Every Naira Went)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 953 0 R/First 954 0 R/Last 955 0 R/Count -5/Next 800 0 R>>
endobj

888 0 obj
<</Title(The 20-For-200 Outreach was made possible by the generosity and commitment of eight partner organisations whose contributions in cash, in kind, and in collaboration made the difference between a good intention and a delivered outcome.)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 800 0 R/Next 956 0 R>>
endobj

889 0 obj
<</Title(Isrina Schools)/Dest[21 0 R/Fit]/Parent 800 0 R/Prev 957 0 R/First 958 0 R/Last 958 0 R/Count -1>>
endobj

890 0 obj
<</Title(Four-Week Skills Acquisition Program)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 703 0 R/Prev 801 0 R/First 959 0 R/Last 960 0 R/Count -5/Next 802 0 R>>
endobj

891 0 obj
<</Title(Quality Education is not a luxury. It is a right. In 2025, COLI directly sponsored 12 students through school, removing the financial barriers that keep children out of classrooms. These 12 represent our unwavering commitment to SDG 4, ensuring inclusive and equitable quality education for all. Each sponsorship is a declaration: your circumstances do not determine your future.)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 802 0 R/Next 892 0 R>>
endobj

892 0 obj
<</Title(Our Scholars Making Us Proud)/Dest[22 0 R/Fit]/Parent 802 0 R/Prev 891 0 R>>
endobj

893 0 obj
<</Title(Your contribution goes directly to community impact \204 fully documented and reported back to you.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 803 0 R>>
endobj

894 0 obj
<</Title(Align your organisation's CSR commitments with verified, SDG- mapped community work in Lagos and beyond.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 804 0 R>>
endobj

895 0 obj
<</Title(We will continue to show up. We hope you will too.)/Dest[23 0 R/Fit]/Parent 705 0 R/Prev 805 0 R/Next 806 0 R>>
endobj

