944 0 obj
<</Title(But we did not stop at food. We believe that dignity is not only about what is on the table today, it is about what a family can build tomorrow. That is why, in 2025, we launched a Skills Acquisition Program that reached 65 children in Ajegunle, equipping them with 4 income-generating skills over a focused 4-week program. Alongside this, we supported 12 out-of-school children through direct education sponsorship, walking with them back into classrooms they had been locked out of by circumstance.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 702 0 R/Prev 881 0 R/Next 979 0 R>>
endobj

945 0 obj
<</Title(To every community we have the privilege of serving \204 you matter. One neighbourhood, one family, one person at a time, we will keep showing up. That is our promise.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 702 0 R/Prev 979 0 R/Next 882 0 R>>
endobj

946 0 obj
<</Title(We are young, committed professionals who believe that  proximity to a problem is not a burden \204 it is an advantage.  We know the communities we serve because we come from them,  live near them, and care about their futures as if they were our  own.)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 799 0 R/Prev 884 0 R/Next 980 0 R>>
endobj

