979 0 obj
<</Title(These programs are not peripheral to our mission, they are its heartbeat. As an organisation committed to SDG 4: Quality Education, we understand that lasting change is built on access to learning, not just access to relief. Every child we equip with a skill, and every child we return to school, is a declaration that their potential is worth investing in.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 702 0 R/Prev 944 0 R/Next 945 0 R>>
endobj

