<</Title(On December 20, 2025,COLI implemented the 20-For-200 Outreach in Ajegunle, Lagos \204 one of Nigeria's most densely populated and underserved communities. The goal was simple and specific: provide food relief and tangible support to vulnerable families during the Christmas season, when need is heightened and visibility often fades.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 952 0 R/Next 1001 0 R>>
