1000 0 obj
<</Title(We strive for the highest standards in every aspect.)/Dest[15 0 R/Fit]/Parent 982 0 R>>
endobj

1001 0 obj
<</Title(Ajegunle was chosen deliberately. Food insecurity here is not seasonal \204 it is structural. Families navigate economic pressure, limited formal employment, and inadequate access to social services daily. The name 20-For-200 was both a target and a challenge. What began as an ambition to reach 200 people on the 20th of December became something greater. With the generosity of our donors and partners, we exceeded our original target and reached 319 beneficiaries in a single day.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 952 0 R/Prev 985 0 R/Next 1014 0 R>>
endobj

