1032 0 obj
<</Title(An outreach of this scale does not happen by goodwill alone. It happens  through planning, training, and the kind of coordination that leaves no beneficiary behind. The 20-For-200 Outreach was delivered through three structured phases.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1022 0 R/First 1038 0 R/Last 1039 0 R/Count -3/Next 1033 0 R>>
endobj

1033 0 obj
<</Title(The result was a distribution process that was not only effective but dignified. Every beneficiary was engaged directly. Crowd coordination was managed by trained volunteers. Elderly adults and mothers with  young children were prioritised. No one was turned away without  acknowledgement. Because how you give is as important as what  you give.)/Dest[18 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1022 0 R/Prev 1032 0 R>>
endobj

